:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-06-02T08:37:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T14:54:51Z","closed_at":"2026-06-04T14:54:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.beta1.mono.official [1c8cc9e7e], v4.7.beta2.mono.official [777579205], v4.7.beta3.mono.official [860821708], v4.7.beta4.mono.official [dff2b9bb6]\n- Not reproducible in: before v4.7 (feature did not exist).\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta4.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 47.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen changing the \"area_texture\" property on an AreaLight3D, the texture property does not function correctly, the light becomes very bright, as well as printing:\n\n```\nERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6750 - Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n  ERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (0) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\n```\n\nwhenever the light is updated / moved. When closing and reopening the scene, the texture appears to work normally. This issue also does not seem to happen when a VoxelGI node is not present in the scene, or when the VoxelGI node visibility is set to false.\n\nVideo from v4.7.beta4.mono.official [dff2b9bb6]:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/253c707e-5625-4a53-9044-f1ac1678b2c3\n\nI would expect for the new texture specified to work within the same scene session with a VoxelGI node.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHave a scene with a VoxelGI node and an AreaLight3D, or use the attached MRP. Change the area_texture of the AreaLight3D.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[AreaLight3DVoxelGIMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28500651/AreaLight3DVoxelGIMRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119960/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119960/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}